+# DatePicker Component 
+ 
+## Description 
+The `DatePicker` component allows users to select a date from a calendar interface. 
+ 
+## Installation 
+```javascript 
+import { DatePicker } from '@wordpress/components'; 
+``` 
+ 
+## Usage 
+```jsx 
+``` 
+ 
+## Props 
+- currentDate (Date) - The initial date. 
+- onChange (Function) - Called when the date changes. 
+ 
+## Storybook 
+View the component in Storybook: [DatePicker](https://wordpress.github.io/gutenberg/?path=/story/components-datepicker--default) 
